1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,080
我也为你生气 戴安
I'm mad for you, Diane.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,500
罗杰这么快就重返情场了吗
Roger's dating already?

3
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:07,060
天啊 我好好奇她是不是比他年轻
OMG, I wonder if she's younger than him.

4
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,840
请稍等
You hold on a second.

5
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:11,700
罗琳 我最爱的客户过得如何呀
Lorraine, how's my favorite client?

6
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:13,860
我最近的事业红得发紫
I've been on something of a hot streak at work.

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,200
我接了一大堆新客户
I've tapped into a rich vein of new clients --

8
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:17,780
都是刚离婚的妈妈们
recently divorced moms.

9
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:20,589
你可以说我挖到了"单亲妈妈矿"
You might say I hit the single-mother lode.

10
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:23,180
主卧室合你心意吗
How about that master suite, huh?

11
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,260
要是有人共享就好了
Maybe if I had someone to share it with.

12
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:29,660
罗琳 你风韵犹存 是抢手的高价货
Lorraine, you are a beautiful woman with a lot to offer.

13
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,100
要给这房子也出个价吗
Should we make an offer?

14
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:35,620
房子是很棒 可惜我单身一人
It's a great house, but I'm just gonna be alone.

15
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:38,700
戴安 你怎么会单身一人
Diane, you're not gonna be alone.

16
00:00:38,988 --> 00:00:40,671
你只需要贷一个款
You're gonna get a loan.

17
00:00:41,054 --> 00:00:43,600
拿着苏打 零食 我们去地下室玩牌
Sodas, snacks -- poker game's in the basement.

18
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:45,380
我比你更需要睡眠
Look, I need more sleep than you,

19
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:47,780
但自从他们把那颗梅树砍了
and ever since they cut down that stupid prune tree,

20
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:49,740
每天早晨阳光就会照得我睡不着
the sun has been right in my eyes every morning.

21
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:52,000
不是梅树 是他们在修枝剪叶
It's not a prune tree. They pruned the tree.

22
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:53,460
我是不会和你换床的
And I'm not switching places with you,

23
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:55,300
你下次掉个头睡就行了
so you should just put your head at the other end of the bed.

24
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:57,600
什么啊 要我的脚枕着枕头睡吗
Uh, why? So my feet get the pillow?

25
00:00:57,600 --> 00:00:58,860
竟然还说我傻
And I'm the dumb one.

26
00:00:58,860 --> 00:01:01,900
戴安 你不能老想着他
Diane, you have got to forget about him.

27
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:03,920
罗杰现在是夏安的问题了
Roger's Cheyenne's problem now.

28
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:04,980
-亲爱的 -知道吗
- Honey... - You know what?

29
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:06,640
你需要找人倾诉
You need to talk.

30
00:01:07,240 --> 00:01:08,640
一起去星巴克喝杯饮料吧
Starbucks for a little go juice?

31
00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:10,080
怎么啦
What is up?

32
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:11,160
我得去一趟办公室
I need to go into the office.

33
00:01:11,260 --> 00:01:12,540
我爸叫我把月记录总结好[月事]
My dad wants me to close out the monthly.

34
00:01:13,420 --> 00:01:13,820
怎么了
What?

35
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:15,800
月事 没事 你继续
Monthly. Never mind. Go on.

36
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,660
我今天会很累 所以需要你
I'm stretched a little thin today, so I need you

37
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:19,460
去买点杂货 照顾一下孩子
to do the grocery shopping, check in on the kids,

38
00:01:19,460 --> 00:01:21,220
或许再顺便把前院的树枝清理了
and maybe clean up those branches in the front yard.

39
00:01:21,460 --> 00:01:22,720
放心加放心
Done and done.

40
00:01:22,940 --> 00:01:23,820
这是个词组
Is that an expression,

41
00:01:23,820 --> 00:01:25,840
还是你真的只记住了我刚才说过的两件事
or did you really only remember two of the things I said?

42
00:01:26,020 --> 00:01:27,900
-后者 -我会给你语音留言备忘的
- The second. - I'll leave you a message.

43
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:31,480
你好啊
Hello?

44
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:32,660
菲尔
Phil.

45
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:33,780
不好意思 再打一次
Sorry. Call back.

46
00:01:48,340 --> 00:01:50,300
我有坏消息 杰
I have bad news, Jay.

47
00:01:50,736 --> 00:01:53,340
乔被赶出金宝贝乐园了
Joe was thrown out of the gymboree.

48
00:01:53,340 --> 00:01:54,560
又被赶出来了 出什么事了
Again? What happened?

49
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:56,500
他推倒了梅森 把他弄哭了
He pushed Mason. He made him cry.

50
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:58,760
老师说不准我们再去
The teacher said that we cannot go back.

51
00:01:58,900 --> 00:02:00,860
太荒谬了 梅森是大孩子了
That's ridiculous. Mason's a big baby.

52
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,840
去那里玩的都是大孩子
Everybody there is a big baby.

53
00:02:02,880 --> 00:02:05,060
但乔玩的时候很凶
But Joe plays very rough.

54
00:02:05,060 --> 00:02:07,880
原因我们都知道 是诅咒
And we know why. It's the curse.

55
00:02:08,180 --> 00:02:10,360
虽然我从来不反对你小点声说话
Not that I'd ever want to discourage you from whispering,

56
00:02:10,489 --> 00:02:12,250
但根本没有诅咒这回事
but that's not a thing.

57
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:14,880
我的家族有恶魔诅咒
There is a mark of the devil in my family.

58
00:02:15,580 --> 00:02:17,020
我的曾曾祖父
My great-great grandfather

59
00:02:17,020 --> 00:02:20,320
得到了翡翠矿址
was given the location of an emerald mine

60
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:21,880
却换走了他的灵魂
in exchange for his soul.

61
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:24,220
有文件之类的记录此事吗
There's, like, paperwork or something that proves this?

62
00:02:24,380 --> 00:02:27,800
他们说在他女儿的婚礼上
And they say that the day of his daughter's wedding,

63
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:29,800
一只大鸟从天而降
a great bird came from the sky

64
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:31,840
用爪子一把抓住他
and snatched him with his claws

65
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:32,980
把他带到遥远的地方去了
and took him far, far away.

66
00:02:33,020 --> 00:02:35,620
你知道你讲过的许多故事的结局
You're aware that a remarkable number of your stories end

67
00:02:35,620 --> 00:02:37,960
都是某个家庭成员被大鸟抓走吧
with a family member being carried off by a giant bird.

68
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:39,540
他们确实是这样告诉我的 杰
I only know what I was told, Jay.

69
00:02:39,540 --> 00:02:41,300
我只是说如果那种事发生超过三次
I'm just saying after the third time,

70
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:42,920
我们应该以后举办室内聚会
we might think about moving the party inside.

71
00:02:44,020 --> 00:02:45,420
好吧 也许不是诅咒
Okay, maybe it's not the curse,

72
00:02:45,420 --> 00:02:48,100
但你知道我的家族是有黑暗面的
but you know that my family has a very dark side.

73
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:50,440
我的表亲奥雷利奥是个偷马贼
My cousin Aurelio is a horse thief.

74
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:53,298
我叔叔卡洛斯幕后操控足球赛 我阿姨
My uncle Carlos fixed soccer games. My aunt --

75
00:02:53,298 --> 00:02:54,660
他是教他们把球捡起来
Did he teach them to pick the ball up

76
00:02:54,660 --> 00:02:55,500
用手扔到场地里吗
and throw it down the field?

77
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:57,240
因为只有那样才能操控足球
'Cause that's the only way you fix soccer.

78
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:59,980
曼尼逃脱了诅咒 但乔我就不知道了
Manny escaped it, but I am not sure about Joe.

79
00:03:00,140 --> 00:03:02,480
歌洛莉亚 是老师太紧张了
Gloria, this is about an uptight teacher.

80
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,780
就算乔有点调皮又怎样
And so what if Joe's a little boisterous?

81
00:03:04,900 --> 00:03:07,440
不是一直都说要让孩子保留真实的风格吗
Whatever happened to letting kids be themselves?

82
00:03:07,820 --> 00:03:09,200
-我准备好了 -把帽子摘了
- Ready. - Lose the hat.

83
00:03:09,780 --> 00:03:11,840
看来我看《音乐之声》都要戴普通帽子了
I guess I'm supposed to see "Sound of Music" in a regular hat.

84
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:13,120
我不反对《音乐之声》
Nothing against "Sound of Music,"

85
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:14,200
但今天下午
but there's a lot of other things

86
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:15,240
我们可以做很多其他事
we could do this afternoon.

87
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:16,300
你听说过《猛龙怪客》吗[1974年电影]
You ever hear of "Death Wish"?

88
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:17,940
我喜欢"死亡之愿"
Oh, I love "Death Wish."

89
00:03:17,940 --> 00:03:21,240
曼尼 那是有病的孩子参加的慈善活动
Manny, that's the charity where the sick kids go to,

90
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,080
比如去麦当娜的音乐会
like, a concert with Madonna

91
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:25,282
或者和贾斯丁·比伯看超级杯 或者
or to the super bowl with Justin Bieber, or they --

92
00:03:25,282 --> 00:03:25,908
不不不
No, no, no, no, no.

93
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:27,580
我说的是电影 70年代的
It's a movie -- New York, '70s,

94
00:03:27,580 --> 00:03:30,380
查尔斯·布朗森扮演一个顾家的好男人
Charles Bronson's a firm family man, and he...

95
00:03:30,380 --> 00:03:31,400
但被逼到绝境
Who's pushed to the limit

96
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:33,200
于是他决定作出反击
until one day he decides to fight back.

97
00:03:33,340 --> 00:03:34,820
-你看过 -片名是《猛龙怪客》这么明显
- You've seen it? - It's called "Death Wish."

98
00:03:35,180 --> 00:03:36,740
我猜结局就是他在公寓里
I doubt it ends with him trading banter

99
00:03:36,740 --> 00:03:38,220
和玛莎·梅森互相调侃
in an apartment with Marsha Mason.

100
00:03:41,260 --> 00:03:42,140
你好啊 未婚夫
Hey, fiance?

101
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:43,360
你好 我的亲夫
Hello, my intended.

102
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:44,860
那听起来像是在说"谋杀亲夫"
That one sounds a little murdery.

103
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:45,920
你就是我的亲夫啊
You are my intended.

104
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:46,940
别说了 别这样
Stop it. Stop it!

105
00:03:46,940 --> 00:03:48,480
你出去的时候
So, while you're out,

106
00:03:48,540 --> 00:03:49,820
我会重新看一下选什么花
I'm gonna review our flower options,

107
00:03:49,980 --> 00:03:52,160
目前为止我很中意"福劳莱与哈代"花店
and I have to say, so far, i'm partial to Floral and Hardy,

108
00:03:52,480 --> 00:03:54,760
但我还要最后看一眼"阿甘花店"的花
but I'm gonna give one last look at Florist Gump.

109
00:03:55,100 --> 00:03:56,840
你就喜欢选名字起得好的
You love a business with a clever name.

110
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:58,300
确实 被你发现了
I do. Guilty.

111
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:00,980
我真是太喜欢现在的状态了
Can I just say I love how this is going?

112
00:04:01,820 --> 00:04:02,780
米奇尔和我一致同意
Mitchell and I agreed

113
00:04:02,780 --> 00:04:04,740
由我来操办婚礼事宜
that I would be in charge of the wedding

114
00:04:04,740 --> 00:04:07,640
上周我们才听说安迪家的悲剧
after the tragic news last week from the Andys.

115
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:09,660
不是指那条山脉[安第斯山]
Uh, not the mountain range. No.

116
00:04:09,780 --> 00:04:11,140
我们的朋友安德鲁和安德鲁
Our friends Andrew and Andrew --

117
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:11,760
他们分手了
they broke up.

118
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,380
筹划婚礼的压力太大
The stress of planning a wedding was too much.

119
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:14,940
他们互相吹毛求疵 争论
They were quibbling about...

120
00:04:14,940 --> 00:04:15,800
每一件事
Everything.

121
00:04:16,126 --> 00:04:18,247
所以我很乐意
I mean, uh, which is why I'm just happy

122
00:04:18,260 --> 00:04:19,100
放任他去发挥
to stay out of his way.

123
00:04:19,220 --> 00:04:21,340
对 我构思远大 然后再精简
Yeah, I dream big. Then I winnow down.

124
00:04:21,620 --> 00:04:22,860
构思远大 再精简
Dream big. Winnow down.

125
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:24,220
-构思远大 -好了 放下来
- Dream big. - Okay, winnow down.

126
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:25,780
没错 别挡着我 抱歉
Yep. Stay out of my way. Sorry.

127
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,520
二爸 拉里哪去了
Daddy, where's Larry?

128
00:04:28,900 --> 00:04:31,400
亲爱的 你知道猫总爱瞎跑的
Oh, well, you know how cats are, sweetie.

129
00:04:31,409 --> 00:04:32,931
他们是 流浪之神
They're -- they're wanderers.

130
00:04:32,940 --> 00:04:35,180
但我都好几天没见着他了
But I haven't seen him in days.

131
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:36,460
没事 他会回家的 好吗
Well, he'll be back, okay?

132
00:04:36,460 --> 00:04:37,400
这事你得信我
Trust daddy on this.

133
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:38,240
好吧
Okay.

134
00:04:39,860 --> 00:04:41,280
我有点担心
You know, I'm starting to get worried

135
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:42,500
拉里可能不会回来了
that Larry might not come back.

136
00:04:42,540 --> 00:04:44,260
-一定已经死了 -什么
- Oh, he's definitely dead. - What?!

137
00:04:44,260 --> 00:04:46,020
不是横尸街头就是已入狼口了
Yeah, street meat or coyote chow.

138
00:04:46,020 --> 00:04:48,080
我们再等几周 再弄只新的
We'll wait a couple weeks, and then we'll get a new Larry.

139
00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:51,827
你对我们宠物的生死有点冷漠啊
Uh, you're pretty nonchalant about our family pet dying.

140
00:04:51,919 --> 00:04:54,220
我们难道不应该帮助闺女度过这一关吗
And shouldn't we help our daughter process this loss?

141
00:04:54,220 --> 00:04:56,440
应该 应该 她会没事的
Yes, we will, and she'll be fine.

142
00:04:56,440 --> 00:04:58,200
我也不是冷漠
And it's not nonchalant.

143
00:04:58,540 --> 00:05:00,700
农场生活就这样 动物死亡很正常
It's farm life. Death is everywhere.

144
00:05:01,020 --> 00:05:03,140
别对他们投入太多情感就行了
You just learn to not get too attached to anything.

145
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:04,540
这么说 要是我死了
Oh, so, what, if I were to die,

146
00:05:04,540 --> 00:05:06,980
你就等几周然后找个人取代我吗
you would just wait a few weeks and then replace me?

147
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:08,240
别说傻话
Of course not.

148
00:05:09,180 --> 00:05:10,780
我上哪儿去找一个跟你
Where would I find another gay Mitchell

149
00:05:10,780 --> 00:05:11,840
一模一样的同性恋米奇尔呢
with your exact markings?

150
00:05:18,115 --> 00:05:19,642
大艾艾 干嘛呢
What's happening, big Al?

151
00:05:19,860 --> 00:05:21,660
再管我叫那名字试试看
Yeah, let's go ahead and veto that nickname.

152
00:05:21,671 --> 00:05:23,660
罗本教会我一个特棒的把戏
Hey, Reuben taught me this cool trick.

153
00:05:23,660 --> 00:05:24,740
眼睛闭上
Close your eyes.

154
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:29,200
我的天 你们什么毛病啊
Oh, my god! What is wrong with you?

155
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,800
妹子让你亲了 现在谁也不欠谁
You kissed a girl. Now we're even.

156
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:32,220
我打扑克牌输给他了
Just paying off a poker debt.

157
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:34,300
卢克的变态朋友刚刚强吻了我
Luke's creepy friend just kissed me.

158
00:05:34,300 --> 00:05:36,380
好恶 罗本吗 那个小怪胎吗
Ew. Reuben? That little weirdo?

159
00:05:36,380 --> 00:05:37,180
我还在这呢
I'm still here.

160
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:38,560
我得把嘴放开水里消消毒
I'm gonna go boil my mouth.

161
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:40,618
兄弟们 去楼下玩游戏
Oh, hey, guys. Game's downstairs.

162
00:05:42,842 --> 00:05:44,240
你们这些笨蛋玩的游戏
This little game you dorks play,

163
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:46,240
赌注到底大不大
we talking milk money or heavy cream?

164
00:05:46,420 --> 00:05:48,180
好些刚收的成人礼礼金呢
A lot of fresh bar mitzvah money down there.

165
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,140
我能参加吗
Mind if I sit in?

166
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:51,200
我们有规定不能带女的
We kind of got a no-girls policy.

167
00:05:51,500 --> 00:05:54,260
是规定还是根本没姑娘要跟你们玩
Is it a policy or just something that keeps happening?

168
00:05:54,355 --> 00:05:55,636
后者啦
The second.

169
00:05:58,860 --> 00:05:59,760
亲爱的 怎么了
Hey, honey.

170
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:02,400
我激动得都不能自已了
I am so excited I can't stand it!

171
00:06:02,400 --> 00:06:03,800
你那手要是再那么扑腾
If you're gonna move your hands around like that,

172
00:06:03,820 --> 00:06:04,880
还是先把电话放下 别摔了
you need to put the phone down.

173
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:05,980
好的 好的 好的
Okay, okay, okay.

174
00:06:05,980 --> 00:06:06,800
餐前鸡尾酒会的部分
For cocktail hour,

175
00:06:06,820 --> 00:06:08,940
他们在为我们设计一座人造瀑布
they're creating a running waterfall

176
00:06:08,940 --> 00:06:10,780
我们两个拥抱的全息影像
onto which they're going to project

177
00:06:10,780 --> 00:06:13,000
会被投影到瀑布上面
a hologram of us embracing.

178
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,820
但我们还是要注重简化 对吧
But we're still winnowing, right?

179
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:15,660
那已经很精简了
Already winnowed.

180
00:06:15,820 --> 00:06:17,220
我舍弃了天使装呢
I cut the angel costumes.

181
00:06:17,620 --> 00:06:18,500
好难抉择的 米奇尔
Hard choices, Mitchell.

182
00:06:18,796 --> 00:06:20,800
好的 我得挂了 太激动啦
Okay, I got to go. I'm so excited!

183
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,160
好吧 我也是
Yeah, me too.

184
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:39,680
我和小卡恋爱最棒的地方在于什么
Best thing about my relationship with Cam?

185
00:06:40,640 --> 00:06:41,240
在于信任
Trust.

186
00:06:42,500 --> 00:06:45,560
快讯一则 我强迫症犯起来也不是人
Newsflash -- I can be an obsessive person.

187
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:49,920
在以前 我根本没法放手让别人
In the past, I've had trouble letting someone else

188
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:51,020
做决定
call the shots.

189
00:06:52,660 --> 00:06:55,260
把大权拱手让人实在令我抓狂
Giving up control made me crazy.

190
00:06:56,940 --> 00:06:59,540
那也是我跟小卡相处得如此轻松的原因
That's what makes my life with Cam so freeing.

191
00:06:59,540 --> 00:07:01,860
我能把大事交由他处理
I can turn over big things to him

192
00:07:01,860 --> 00:07:04,180
然后自己不再去担心
and never give them a second thought.

193
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:07,320
眼不见 心不烦 拜拜了您
Out of sight, out of mind. Bye-bye.

194
00:07:18,062 --> 00:07:18,924
菲尔
Phil.

195
00:07:19,329 --> 00:07:20,190
这也
This is --

196
00:07:20,677 --> 00:07:22,572
我的天啊
Oh! Oh, my god!

197
00:07:22,754 --> 00:07:23,565
菲尔
Phil?

198
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,140
-菲尔你在吗 -我就坐那儿
- Phil?! - Yeah, I was just sitting there,

199
00:07:26,140 --> 00:07:27,420
他就猥亵我了
and he basically molested me.

200
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,420
你说什么
Excuse me?

201
00:07:28,619 --> 00:07:30,218
她说的是罗本
She's talking about Reuben.

202
00:07:30,300 --> 00:07:30,820
你又是谁
Who are you?!

203
00:07:30,980 --> 00:07:32,000
你们男的最好把钱带够了
You boys better have money.

204
00:07:32,100 --> 00:07:33,440
不给钱姐可不干
I am not doing this for free.

205
00:07:33,440 --> 00:07:35,356
你们 你们要干嘛
W-w-what's -- what's happening?

206
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:36,360
我听明白了 乔伊斯
Oh, I hear you, Joyce.

207
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:38,800
他的时间宝贵 你的就不宝贵 是吧
His time's important. Your time isn't, right?

208
00:07:39,500 --> 00:07:41,220
一会打给你 超级巨星
Let me buzz you back, superstar.

209
00:07:41,220 --> 00:07:41,960
好嘞
Okay.

210
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:43,000
亲爱的
Hey, honey.

211
00:07:43,180 --> 00:07:44,400
前院的树枝还在那
Branches are still in the front yard,

212
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:45,720
我脸都被弹肿了
I just took a rake to the face,

213
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:47,700
罗本对艾丽克斯有奇怪的企图
Reuben is getting really weird on Alex,

214
00:07:47,700 --> 00:07:50,460
海莉为了钱在地下室不知做什么呢
And Haley's doing something for money in the basement.

215
00:07:50,620 --> 00:07:51,620
没什么大不了啦
It's all gonna be fine.

216
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:53,060
老爸回来了 超级巨星
Daddy's home, superstar.

217
00:07:53,060 --> 00:07:54,440
别 别那么叫我
No. Don't call me that.

218
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:56,200
我跟那些粘人的离婚妇女不一样
I'm not one of your needy little divorces.

219
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:58,580
那是我的工作而已
Um, that is work.

220
00:07:58,720 --> 00:07:59,540
是吗
Is it?

221
00:07:59,900 --> 00:08:01,800
因为我觉得你都爱上
'Cause I kind of feel like part of you loves

222
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:02,960
充当这些女人的英雄了
being a hero to those women.

223
00:08:03,060 --> 00:08:04,440
我是在帮助她们
I'm a helper of people.

224
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:07,640
你当初追我这个房产中介的时候
Hey, you knew what you signed up for

225
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:09,920
就应当料到会有这些后果了
when you hitched your wagon to a realtor man.

226
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:11,060
亲爱的 我们认识时
Honey, when I met you,

227
00:08:11,060 --> 00:08:12,666
你还是个婚礼DJ
you were a wedding deejay.

228
00:08:13,178 --> 00:08:14,160
顺便说一句 DJ先生
By the way, Spinderfella,

229
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,820
看样子你还得去趟杂货店
looks like you still need to hit the grocery store.

230
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:17,360
我觉得某人感到被冷落了
I think someone's feeling neglected.

231
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:20,280
没错 我跟很多寂寞妇女打交道
Yes, I deal with a lot of lonely women,

232
00:08:20,640 --> 00:08:22,240
但我娶了的寂寞妇女只有你一个
but there's only one I'm married to.

233
00:08:23,520 --> 00:08:24,680
你有点忘乎所以了 菲尔
You're getting too involved, Phil.

234
00:08:25,060 --> 00:08:26,460
你在哄骗这些女人
You are juggling these women,

235
00:08:26,460 --> 00:08:27,940
而你水平其实很有限
and you're not that good a juggler.

236
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:30,780
你是在说气话
Now you're just lashing out!

237
00:08:33,154 --> 00:08:34,438
来这边
Hey, come here.

238
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,480
我没告诉杰
I didn't tell Jay,

239
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:39,600
但有时候连我自己都害怕乔
but sometimes Joe even scares me.

240
00:08:40,500 --> 00:08:42,320
万幸的是 有专业人士
Lucky for me, there are professionals

241
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:45,260
来帮我解决这些问题
that are trained to deal with such problems.

242
00:08:45,260 --> 00:08:47,207
您好 谢谢您过来 神父
Ay, thank you for coming, padre.

243
00:08:47,207 --> 00:08:48,740
小事一桩 歌洛莉亚
Oh, of course, Gloria.

244
00:08:48,740 --> 00:08:50,460
这肯定是弗汉希欧啦
And this must be Fulgencio.

245
00:08:50,640 --> 00:08:52,900
小伙子真帅呀
What a beautiful little boy.

246
00:08:53,380 --> 00:08:54,940
他天性纯良
He's such a sweet nature.

247
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:56,960
我能看得出他本性善良
I can tell he's a gentle soul.

248
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:59,884
弗汉希欧 松手 松手
Ah! Hey, Fulgencio, no, no.

249
00:09:03,380 --> 00:09:04,660
抱歉 神父
Sorry, padre.

250
00:09:04,660 --> 00:09:07,740
这也正是我找您来的原因
Ay, that's why I called you, Father.

251
00:09:08,060 --> 00:09:08,960
我觉得这个孩子很坏
I think he's bad.

252
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,755
我的家族有恶魔诅咒
There is evil in my family.

253
00:09:10,755 --> 00:09:13,320
歌洛莉亚 他还只是个婴儿呢
Ah, Gloria, he's just a little baby.

254
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:15,340
上礼拜 他眼睛变红了
Last week, his eyes got red,

255
00:09:15,340 --> 00:09:16,880
连狗都被他吓跑了
and the dog backed away.

256
00:09:17,060 --> 00:09:18,720
他可能只是感冒了而已
He probably just had a cold.

257
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:20,420
每个妈妈都喜欢担心
All mothers worry.

258
00:09:20,420 --> 00:09:23,680
你看他 气色红润 乖乖地玩积木呢
Look at him -- rosy cheeks, he's playing with his blocks.

259
00:09:25,900 --> 00:09:27,380
又是六
The six again.

260
00:09:27,940 --> 00:09:30,720
因为乔推到了一个小孩 就把他开除
So, Joe knocks one kid down, he's out.

261
00:09:31,140 --> 00:09:32,240
小孩子都这样
All kids do that.

262
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:34,640
不然你那整栋楼怎么都是防撞材料造的
Why do you think your whole building is made out of nerf?

263
00:09:35,260 --> 00:09:36,800
是啊 你现在知道我小孩的脾气随谁了
Yeah, you see where he gets it from.

264
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:38,760
听着 我可不怕你 黛比老师
Hey, listen, I'm not afraid of you, Miss Debbie.

265
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:40,340
你不是...该死
You're not the -- damn it.

266
00:09:40,700 --> 00:09:42,240
看来某人该去纳粹占领的奥地利
Sounds like someone needs a relaxing trip

267
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,540
来个放松之旅了
to nazi-occupied Austria.

268
00:09:43,580 --> 00:09:44,780
她居然挂我电话
Can't believe she hung up on me.

269
00:09:44,820 --> 00:09:45,840
谁让你冲着人家吼来着
Well, you were yelling at her.

270
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:48,500
我这是坚持原则 是不同的
Standing up for yourself is not the same thing as, uh --

271
00:09:48,500 --> 00:09:49,220
你等会
Excuse me.

272
00:09:50,177 --> 00:09:50,940
算了吧 杰
Uh, come on, Jay.

273
00:09:50,940 --> 00:09:52,620
你家没家教的
So no one ever taught you manners, huh?

274
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:53,540
你想怎样
Whatever, dude.

275
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:55,300
你撞了人就应该道歉
No, you bump into somebody, you apologize.

276
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:57,400
既然我都要给你上一课了
And since I'm teaching you something here,

277
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:59,460
就先从"好好穿裤子"开始吧
here's a little class called "Intro to pants."

278
00:09:59,460 --> 00:10:00,140
杰 住手
Jay, stop!

279
00:10:00,140 --> 00:10:01,020
放开我
Get off me!

280
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,740
我和那些孩子是同校生
I go to school with those kids.

281
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:05,000
你知不知道你这样多丢人
You know how embarrassing that was?

282
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,217
-曼尼 -别说了
- Manny. - No.

283
00:10:06,385 --> 00:10:08,106
你为什么老是这样
Why do you always got to be like this --

284
00:10:08,106 --> 00:10:10,193
爱评判别人 脾气爆 还大嗓门
judgmental, hot-tempered, loud?

285
00:10:10,193 --> 00:10:11,983
这些都是我最讨厌的事
These are a few of my least-favorite things.

286
00:10:14,060 --> 00:10:16,660
我看得出你跟这房子有缘 戴安
Well, I can see that the house speaks to you, Diane.

287
00:10:16,754 --> 00:10:17,760
"买下我吧"
"Buy me."

288
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:18,960
现在还不行
Not now, house.

289
00:10:20,350 --> 00:10:22,800
开放式的布局 宽敞的厨房 多好
Ah, the open floor plan, the spacious kitchen.

290
00:10:22,800 --> 00:10:23,620
我确实很喜欢
I do love it.

291
00:10:25,183 --> 00:10:26,600
是我办公室打来的
That's -- that's the office.

292
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:28,240
我何不再去后院最后看上一眼呢
Why don't you take one last look at the backyard?

293
00:10:28,460 --> 00:10:29,420
有没有想到"露天烧烤"
Did someone say barbecue?

294
00:10:29,420 --> 00:10:30,560
我有哦
"I did."

295
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:36,160
罗琳 怎么了
Lorraine, what is up?

296
00:10:36,683 --> 00:10:40,363
没忙什么呀 就在办公室呗
Nothing. Just kicking it at the office.

297
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:43,160
慢点慢点
Slow down, now.

298
00:10:43,280 --> 00:10:44,380
有什么事跟菲尔说
Tell Phil what happened.

299
00:10:44,620 --> 00:10:46,620
菲尔 我能不能去车库看看
Phil, can I go in the garage?

300
00:10:47,040 --> 00:10:48,660
你就把这当自己家 随意 妹妹
Make yourself at home, sister.

301
00:10:52,340 --> 00:10:55,400
刚才是我妹妹 她来看我
That was my sister who is visiting town

302
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:56,200
顺便看看我办公室
-- and my office,

303
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,820
我就是从办公室打给你的
which is where I am calling you from.

304
00:10:57,820 --> 00:10:58,800
是你打给我的
You called me.

305
00:11:02,580 --> 00:11:04,320
我很担心拉里
I'm worried about Larry.

306
00:11:04,900 --> 00:11:06,860
宝贝儿 我知道
Oh, honey, I know.

307
00:11:07,420 --> 00:11:08,040
他去哪了
Where is he?

308
00:11:08,040 --> 00:11:10,895
莉莉 有件事也许我该告诉你
Um, Lily, there's probably something I should tell you.

309
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:14,480
拉里不会回来了
Larry's not coming back home.

310
00:11:15,140 --> 00:11:16,260
为什么 他死了吗
Why? Is he dead?

311
00:11:16,610 --> 00:11:19,091
不 他没死
Nope. Um, not dead.

312
00:11:19,124 --> 00:11:21,420
拉里遇到了意中人
Larry, uh, met someone, fell in love,

313
00:11:21,420 --> 00:11:22,620
结婚了
and he got married.

314
00:11:22,940 --> 00:11:24,180
他们会来探望我们吗
Are they ever going to visit?

315
00:11:24,180 --> 00:11:27,920
恐怕不会 因为当猫结婚以后
I'm afraid not because when cats get married,

316
00:11:27,988 --> 00:11:30,645
他们就必须搬去树林里
they have to move to, um, the forest,

317
00:11:30,800 --> 00:11:34,360
这样就不会受到城市里其它猫的诱惑
and so then they're not tempted by other cats in the city.

318
00:11:35,100 --> 00:11:36,300
-那是拉里呀 -我知道
- It's Larry. - I know.

319
00:11:36,340 --> 00:11:37,920
就算是你平时认为坚强的人
Even people that you would never expect

320
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:39,820
-也会有软弱的时候 -不 在那
- have moments of weakness. - No, over there.

321
00:11:39,980 --> 00:11:41,220
可是他妻子呢
But where's his wife?

322
00:11:42,220 --> 00:11:42,920
你好 拉里
Hello, Larry.

323
00:11:43,540 --> 00:11:44,220
拉里回来了
Larry's back.

324
00:11:44,710 --> 00:11:46,646
你知道吗
Yeah, uh, well, you know what?

325
00:11:46,646 --> 00:11:48,920
我猜他俩可能不合适
I think they probably, uh, didn't work out,

326
00:11:48,920 --> 00:11:49,720
于是就分手了
and they broke up.

327
00:11:49,940 --> 00:11:51,400
结婚了以后还能分手吗
People get married and then break up?

328
00:11:51,400 --> 00:11:53,340
要是你和爸爸也分手呢
What if that happens to you and daddy?

329
00:11:53,340 --> 00:11:55,553
你知道吗 是爸爸搞错了
Oh, y-you know what? Daddy made a mistake.

330
00:11:55,553 --> 00:11:57,443
拉里和他的妻子没有分手
Uh, Larry and his wife didn't break up.

331
00:11:57,460 --> 00:12:00,080
拉里的妻子 去世了
Larry's wife...died.

332
00:12:00,680 --> 00:12:01,640
不是吧
Oh, no.

333
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:02,600
是啊
Yeah.

334
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:05,360
所以我们要给拉里一个了结
That's why we're gonna give him the closure he needs

335
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:07,900
我们要给他的妻子
by throwing, um, a funeral

336
00:12:07,900 --> 00:12:11,580
举行一场葬礼来纪念她精彩的一生
to celebrate the remarkable life of Larry's wife.

337
00:12:11,782 --> 00:12:13,111
葬礼会很棒的 你知道吗
It's gonna be great. You know what?

338
00:12:13,111 --> 00:12:15,483
我们会准备现场音乐 还有鞋盒
We're gonna have music, we're gonna get a shoe box...

339
00:12:15,483 --> 00:12:16,790
还有蜡烛
...we're gonna have candles.

340
00:12:16,790 --> 00:12:19,257
喂 阿甘花店 又是我
Yes. Hi, Florist Gump. It's me again.

341
00:12:19,300 --> 00:12:22,080
独自解决这个危机的感觉真好
It felt good to handle that crisis on my own.

342
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:24,380
在过去 我肯定第一时间找米奇尔求助
In the past, I would have had to run to Mitchell,

343
00:12:24,520 --> 00:12:26,940
但是他现在越来越信任我了
but he's been trusting me more and more.

344
00:12:27,700 --> 00:12:28,800
我真为他骄傲
I'm so proud of him.

345
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:31,180
他真的学会了放手
He's really learned to let things go.

346
00:12:33,040 --> 00:12:35,400
不 天啊 不 不 不
Oh, no! God, no, no, no!

347
00:12:48,020 --> 00:12:48,540
干吗
What?

348
00:12:48,540 --> 00:12:50,200
我们在楼下被血洗了
It's a bloodbath down there.

349
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,260
输得分文不剩
We lost everything.

350
00:12:51,260 --> 00:12:52,300
你不是很厉害吗
I thought you were good.

351
00:12:52,420 --> 00:12:53,500
我总是能赢迪兰呀
I always beat Dylan.

352
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:55,080
求你了 我们需要你
Come on. We need your help.

353
00:12:55,180 --> 00:12:56,480
你是家里扑克打得最好的人了
You're the best card player in this family.

354
00:12:56,640 --> 00:12:57,600
我有什么好处
What's in it for me?

355
00:12:57,780 --> 00:12:59,780
-一个做好姐姐的机会 -免了
- A chance to be a good sister. - Pass.

356
00:13:00,340 --> 00:13:01,447
罗本到处跟别人说
Reuben's been telling everyone

357
00:13:01,460 --> 00:13:02,260
你主动跟他舌吻
you slipped him the tongue.

358
00:13:04,580 --> 00:13:04,980
让开
Move.

359
00:13:07,940 --> 00:13:09,960
猫不是有九条命吗
I thought cats had nine lives.

360
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:10,800
是啊 的确如此
Yeah, and they do,

361
00:13:10,860 --> 00:13:12,560
但拉里的妻子比他年长
but Larry's wife was older than he was,

362
00:13:12,560 --> 00:13:14,760
而且她已经结过八次婚了
and she'd been married eight times before.

363
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:16,020
就像伊丽莎白·泰勒那样吗
Like Elizabeth Taylor?

364
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:19,080
你记得我给你讲的睡前故事
Oh, you remember our bedtime stories.

365
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:22,540
迪兰 谢谢你这么快赶来
Oh, Dylan, thank you for coming on such short notice.

366
00:13:22,780 --> 00:13:24,380
我需要你在这边挖个洞
I just need you to dig a hole right over here.

367
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:25,740
-谢谢 -没问题
- Thank you. - Oh, no problem.

368
00:13:26,180 --> 00:13:27,860
莉莉 请节哀顺变
So, Lily, I'm really sorry.

369
00:13:28,220 --> 00:13:29,000
拉里还好吗
How's Larry doing?

370
00:13:29,160 --> 00:13:30,520
很好 他是只快乐的小猫
Fine. He's a happy cat.

371
00:13:30,780 --> 00:13:32,300
原来是猫啊
Oh, they're cats.

372
00:13:32,860 --> 00:13:34,620
这下我的工作就轻松多了
That's gonna make my job a lot easier.

373
00:13:36,700 --> 00:13:38,520
好了 各位 感谢你们前来
Okay, everyone, thank you for coming.

374
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:41,280
这对莉莉很重要 对我也很重要
It means a lot to Lily, and it means a lot to me.

375
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:42,160
安格斯
Angus?

376
00:13:43,380 --> 00:13:45,920
关于拉里的爱妻 我该说些什么呢
So, Larry's wife -- what can I say?

377
00:13:46,280 --> 00:13:47,460
她很爱拉里
She loved Larry.

378
00:13:47,528 --> 00:13:50,240
和天下所有猫夫妻一样
And, um, you know, like all cat marriages,

379
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:51,740
他们经历了起起落落
they had their ups and their downs,

380
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:53,980
但他们都一同挺了过来
but they always landed on their feet.

381
00:13:54,620 --> 00:13:55,800
凿到石头了
Oh, hit a rock.

382
00:13:56,900 --> 00:13:58,160
不是石头
Oh! Not a rock!

383
00:13:58,280 --> 00:13:58,980
各位
Okay, everybody!

384
00:13:59,080 --> 00:14:00,900
请保持冷静 保持冷静
Please stay calm! Please stay calm!

385
00:14:00,900 --> 00:14:02,620
别乱跑 地很滑
No running! It's slippery!

386
00:14:02,620 --> 00:14:03,680
安格斯 继续演奏
Angus, keep playing!

387
00:14:03,680 --> 00:14:04,500
好
Okay.

388
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:09,580
-兰德尔 -怎么了
- Randall! - Yeah?

389
00:14:10,100 --> 00:14:11,020
我在上面
I'm up here.

390
00:14:12,400 --> 00:14:13,140
普里契特先生吗
Mr. Pritchett?

391
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:14,720
这都是实习工作的相关文件
This is all intern work.

392
00:14:14,760 --> 00:14:15,740
不是为我的乐队打印的
It isn't for my band.

393
00:14:15,740 --> 00:14:17,580
需要我去帮忙买咖啡吗
Need me to do a coffee run?

394
00:14:18,400 --> 00:14:18,680
不
No.

395
00:14:19,466 --> 00:14:22,260
不是 听我说 我刚刚在打扫
No, uh, listen, I was -- I was cleaning,

396
00:14:22,260 --> 00:14:24,060
然后被卡在这上面了
and I got stuck up here,

397
00:14:24,060 --> 00:14:26,520
我需要你去我的办公室
and I need you to go into my office

398
00:14:26,520 --> 00:14:28,640
把倒下的梯子扶起来
and stand up the ladder that fell.

399
00:14:28,880 --> 00:14:29,460
好的
Got it.

400
00:14:30,040 --> 00:14:32,140
抱歉我刚刚撒了谎
And I'm sorry about lying before.

401
00:14:32,760 --> 00:14:34,040
这是我们乐队的宣传单
Those are flyers for my band,

402
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:34,620
叫"实习生乐队"
the Interns.

403
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:38,760
你的门是锁着的
Uh-oh. Your door's locked.

404
00:14:39,100 --> 00:14:39,980
糟糕
Oh, no.

405
00:14:40,124 --> 00:14:42,780
但如果你可以向前挪一点
But, hey, I-I think, if you keep going forward,

406
00:14:42,780 --> 00:14:44,360
然后转身把腿从通风口伸下来
then back your legs out through the vent,

407
00:14:44,360 --> 00:14:46,280
我想我可以抓住你的腿把你扶下来
I can grab them to help you down.

408
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:47,420
我不确定
Oh, I don't know.

409
00:14:47,420 --> 00:14:48,540
这让我有点紧张
That makes me a little nervous.

410
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:49,980
想想别的事情
Just think about something else.

411
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:52,020
我听说你要结婚了 进行得怎么样了
I heard you're getting married. How's that going?

412
00:14:52,280 --> 00:14:54,240
是啊是啊
Oh, yeah, yeah.

413
00:14:54,251 --> 00:14:56,801
还不错 不错
It's -- it's good. It's good.

414
00:14:57,060 --> 00:14:58,840
我们正在策划婚礼
You know, we're planning it right now.

415
00:14:58,860 --> 00:15:01,160
实际上 是有人在为我策划
Actually, it's being planned for me.

416
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,760
不错啊 毫无压力
That's nice. No stress.

417
00:15:02,774 --> 00:15:04,400
本该是这样 对吧
Oh, you'd think, huh?

418
00:15:04,400 --> 00:15:06,480
但事情有些失控了
But it's getting a little bit out of hand.

419
00:15:06,480 --> 00:15:08,300
策划婚礼总是这样的
Oh, that happens with weddings.

420
00:15:08,300 --> 00:15:08,840
是吗
Does it?

421
00:15:09,100 --> 00:15:10,820
你去过几个婚礼上是有
I mean, how many weddings have you been to

422
00:15:10,820 --> 00:15:12,740
"鸽子发射器"这种东西的
that have something called a dove cannon?

423
00:15:12,740 --> 00:15:14,220
我觉得在这种事情上
You know, I think I should have a say

424
00:15:14,220 --> 00:15:15,180
我应该也有话语权的
in something like that.

425
00:15:15,560 --> 00:15:16,900
你得放手了 普里契特先生
You need to let go, Mr. Pritchett.

426
00:15:16,900 --> 00:15:18,240
我做不到
I-I can't.

427
00:15:18,240 --> 00:15:20,720
我希望我能做到 不我不能
I-I wish I could, but I can't.

428
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:22,300
我...这太让我抓狂了
I just -- it's freaking me out.

429
00:15:22,300 --> 00:15:23,720
不 我是说我扶住你了
No, I've got you already.

430
00:15:25,220 --> 00:15:25,680
好吧
Okay.

431
00:15:26,079 --> 00:15:26,910
好
Yeah.

432
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:29,320
谢谢
Thank you.

433
00:15:29,780 --> 00:15:32,380
我很善于理解别人的想法
You know, I'm pretty good at reading people,

434
00:15:32,380 --> 00:15:33,920
听起来您和您太太真的需要
and it sounds like you and your lady

435
00:15:33,920 --> 00:15:35,180
通过沟通来解决问题
really need to talk this out.

436
00:15:36,180 --> 00:15:37,540
是啊 也许你说得对
Yeah, maybe you're right.

437
00:15:38,560 --> 00:15:39,780
我告诉你一个小秘密吧
So I'm gonna let you in on a little secret.

438
00:15:41,060 --> 00:15:42,680
-我是同性恋 -天哪
- I'm gay. - Oh, my god.

439
00:15:43,800 --> 00:15:44,420
她知道吗
Does she know?

440
00:15:45,323 --> 00:15:47,242
得给新婚之夜留点惊喜不是吗
Got to save something for the wedding night, huh?

441
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:48,680
好了
Okay.

442
00:15:50,500 --> 00:15:52,680
莱利 别这样 巴斯特 快坐下
Riley, no! Buster, please sit!

443
00:15:52,780 --> 00:15:54,000
迪兰 来帮忙
Dylan, help!

444
00:15:54,500 --> 00:15:55,460
我帮不了
I can't!

445
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:58,160
这些猫猫狗狗打得不可开交
These cats and dogs are fighting like -- oh!

446
00:15:58,500 --> 00:15:59,720
好了 各位 很抱歉
Okay, everybody, I'm sorry.

447
00:15:59,780 --> 00:16:01,840
这本该是一场小型仪式
This was supposed to be a small service,

448
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:03,600
但我没有控制好自己
but I don't winnow down.

449
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:04,640
我做得过火了
I overdo.

450
00:16:04,780 --> 00:16:07,660
要是我连给猫办场假葬礼都做不好
And if I let a simple fake cat funeral get out of hand,

451
00:16:07,660 --> 00:16:09,740
我要怎么才能办好整场婚礼呢
how am I supposed to plan an entire wedding?

452
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:12,000
你们迟到了
You're late.

453
00:16:12,520 --> 00:16:13,860
我需要我家米奇尔
Okay, I need Mitchell.

454
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:14,860
好消息
Good news.

455
00:16:15,040 --> 00:16:16,120
他刚停下车
He just pulled up.

456
00:16:16,500 --> 00:16:17,200
该死
Damn it.

457
00:16:17,680 --> 00:16:18,780
好 进来 快进来
Okay, in. In, in.

458
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:20,100
好 好
Yes. Okay.

459
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:22,660
能来个人把那东西抓住吗 拜托了
And, please, can somebody catch that thing?

460
00:16:22,920 --> 00:16:24,280
好 好的 都留下
Okay, all right, stay.

461
00:16:24,420 --> 00:16:26,740
各位...
Everyone just...

462
00:16:26,740 --> 00:16:28,740
去健身感觉怎么样
Hey! How was the gym?

463
00:16:28,860 --> 00:16:30,140
我没去成
I never made it.

464
00:16:30,513 --> 00:16:32,620
小卡 有些事我得跟你谈谈
Listen, Cam, I got to talk about something.

465
00:16:32,620 --> 00:16:33,240
我也是
I do, too.

466
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:35,520
你想不想参与到婚礼的策划中来
What would you think about being more involved with the wedding?

467
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:37,380
这正是我要谈的事
That's what I wanted to talk about.

468
00:16:37,400 --> 00:16:38,340
我很乐意
I would love to.

469
00:16:38,500 --> 00:16:39,040
谢天谢地
Thank god.

470
00:16:39,040 --> 00:16:41,960
我就是觉得我们...我们一起会更好
You know, I just think we're -- we're better together.

471
00:16:42,133 --> 00:16:44,822
"一起会更好" 我喜欢这说法
"Better together." Mm, I like that.

472
00:16:46,040 --> 00:16:48,100
我无法和蛇同处一室
I cannot be in a house with snakes.

473
00:16:49,900 --> 00:16:50,780
有多糟
How bad is it?

474
00:16:51,080 --> 00:16:51,880
大概需要一个小时清理现场
Gonna need about an hour.

475
00:16:53,199 --> 00:16:54,139
给你
Here you go.

476
00:16:54,564 --> 00:16:56,261
我给你买了"雪顶"巧克力
I got you Sno-caps,

477
00:16:56,800 --> 00:16:58,620
因为最后他们成功穿越阿尔卑斯雪山逃跑了
'cause, you know, at the end, they escape across the alps.

478
00:16:58,820 --> 00:17:00,000
感谢剧透
Thanks for ruining it.

479
00:17:00,120 --> 00:17:02,060
淡定点 这电影都出了五十年了
Calm down. The movie's 50 years old.

480
00:17:02,740 --> 00:17:04,260
你真是处处"交友"啊
Making friends everywhere, aren't you?

481
00:17:06,820 --> 00:17:09,040
你总是说 "要表达出你的感情"
Listen, you always say, "Express your feelings."

482
00:17:09,520 --> 00:17:10,980
我生气时就是这样
When I get mad, that's what I do.

483
00:17:11,140 --> 00:17:12,460
喂 我讲话方便
Hello? Yeah, I can talk.

484
00:17:12,640 --> 00:17:14,540
我爸妈拉我来看一部烂片
My parents dragged me into this stupid movie.

485
00:17:14,550 --> 00:17:16,683
上吧 杰 把他的手机塞他嘴里
Go ahead, Jay. Feed him his phone.

486
00:17:17,340 --> 00:17:18,640
你是在说你不介意我那么做吗
You're telling me that doesn't bother you?

487
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:19,920
我听不清楚 大声点
I can't hear you. Talk louder.

488
00:17:20,080 --> 00:17:20,860
我只是说
I'm just saying...

489
00:17:20,980 --> 00:17:22,360
如果一有脾气就发作
...if we give in to every impulse,

490
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:23,980
那我们和禽兽就没有区别了
we're no better than wild animals.

491
00:17:24,140 --> 00:17:26,560
但如果把怒气忍回去 会被活活气死的
But if we push it down, it eats you alive.

492
00:17:26,560 --> 00:17:27,800
不介意不就行了吗
Not if you just let it go.

493
00:17:27,800 --> 00:17:30,329
那部烂片《欢乐满人间》的女主角演的
The chick from that crapfest "Mary Poppins."

494
00:17:30,340 --> 00:17:31,140
我受够了
That's it.

495
00:17:35,580 --> 00:17:37,960
我妈开计程车时 我一个人在家里
A lot of cold, lonely nights in that apartment by myself

496
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:39,580
度过了很多寒冷孤独的夜
while my mom was driving a taxi,

497
00:17:39,580 --> 00:17:41,140
只有一样东西陪伴我
and only one thing kept me company.

498
00:17:41,500 --> 00:17:43,000
如果你对《欢乐满人间》有意见
So, you got a problem with poppins,

499
00:17:43,180 --> 00:17:44,520
那就是对我有意见
you got a problem with me.

500
00:17:46,206 --> 00:17:48,451
神父 真是对不起
Ay, Father, I am so sorry.

501
00:17:48,820 --> 00:17:51,040
我根本不知道他可以拿起叉子
I didn't even know that he could hold a fork.

502
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:52,760
不 是我自己不好
No, no, no, I blame myself.

503
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:54,620
我不应该跟他玩"摘鼻子"游戏
I probably shouldn't have taken his nose.

504
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:56,640
不 是我家里的遗传问题
No, it's my family.

505
00:17:56,860 --> 00:17:58,040
我家女孩都胸部丰满
The girls are very chesty,

506
00:17:58,060 --> 00:18:00,320
但是男孩都有魔性
but the men, they're kissed by the devil.

507
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:03,080
歌洛莉亚 你这么担心
Gloria, the fact that you are so concerned

508
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:06,000
只是证明了你是一个有爱心的好妈妈
is only proof that you are a loving and caring mother.

509
00:18:06,488 --> 00:18:09,119
对孩子们影响最大的是父母
It's the parents who shape the child.

510
00:18:09,140 --> 00:18:11,860
你儿子的成长环境非常棒
And your son is growing up in a wonderful home.

511
00:18:12,380 --> 00:18:13,020
去死吧 人渣
Die, scum!

512
00:18:13,100 --> 00:18:14,200
不行不行
No, no, no!

513
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:14,940
大声点 像你刚才
Louder, like you did

514
00:18:14,940 --> 00:18:15,820
在得来速快餐店那样
at the drive-through.

515
00:18:15,820 --> 00:18:17,580
妈 杰和我看了《猛龙怪客》
Mom, Jay and I saw "Death Wish."

516
00:18:17,820 --> 00:18:18,260
太好看了
Amazing.

517
00:18:18,400 --> 00:18:20,220
曼尼在看《音乐之声》时和人打架
Manny got in a fight at "The Sound of Music,"

518
00:18:20,340 --> 00:18:21,120
被赶出来了
got kicked out.

519
00:18:21,360 --> 00:18:22,660
我从来没有这样骄傲过
I've never been so proud.

520
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:25,580
我想所有家庭
Well, I guess every household

521
00:18:25,590 --> 00:18:27,220
都用得上一些指导和调整
could use a little fine-tuning, huh?

522
00:18:27,220 --> 00:18:28,420
我给你我的名片
Let me give you my card

523
00:18:28,420 --> 00:18:29,723
-上面有我手机号 -太好了
- with my cell number on it. - Please.

524
00:18:29,723 --> 00:18:32,184
我的钱包去哪里了
And what did I do with my wallet? I...

525
00:18:41,340 --> 00:18:44,080
我指责菲尔不帮忙
I had yelled at Phil for not helping out,

526
00:18:44,080 --> 00:18:47,120
他却在那里 做我让他做的事情
and there he was, doing exactly what I had asked him to do...

527
00:18:47,434 --> 00:18:49,170
西葫芦来啦
Here's our zucchini.

528
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:50,700
上来吧 小家伙
Up top, buddy.

529
00:18:51,280 --> 00:18:52,500
却是在给别的家庭做
...for some other family.

530
00:18:52,860 --> 00:18:55,060
你这样帮我们 你真是太好了
You are so sweet for helping me with this.

531
00:18:55,300 --> 00:18:56,460
你受到了那么大的伤害 罗琳
How hurt you've been, Lorraine --

532
00:18:56,980 --> 00:18:59,640
这个很好 这不算什么
This is sweet. This is...normal.

533
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:01,320
菲尔
Phil?

534
00:19:02,600 --> 00:19:03,000
戴安
Diane?

535
00:19:03,600 --> 00:19:04,400
你好 超级巨星
Hey, superstar.

536
00:19:04,620 --> 00:19:05,880
你不是叫我超级巨星吗
I thought I was superstar.

537
00:19:06,020 --> 00:19:08,000
你的丈夫对我真是太好了
Oh, your husband has been so wonderful to me.

538
00:19:08,020 --> 00:19:09,660
他不是我的丈夫 他是我的房产中介
He's not my husband. He's my realtor.

539
00:19:09,760 --> 00:19:10,900
他是我的房产中介
Oh, he's my realtor.

540
00:19:10,900 --> 00:19:11,974
我是你们的房产中介
I'm both your realtors.

541
00:19:11,985 --> 00:19:13,080
我真幸运能拥有如此...
I-I'm just lucky to have such a --

542
00:19:13,080 --> 00:19:14,900
我们正准备去看房子
We're on our way to an open house.

543
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:16,560
所以你才不能带我去看
Oh, is that why you couldn't

544
00:19:16,560 --> 00:19:17,620
那栋殖民风格的房子吗
show me the colonial later?

545
00:19:17,620 --> 00:19:19,214
我做了你喜欢的玉米面包
I made that corn bread that you like.

546
00:19:19,214 --> 00:19:20,200
我们会去看的
W-we're gonna make it to that.

547
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:21,380
我只需要结束和罗琳的事
I just have to finish up with Lorraine.

548
00:19:21,500 --> 00:19:23,160
你是说 快点了结吗
Oh, you mean, like, "Get it over with"?

549
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:23,991
不 我不是那个意思
No, I-I don't mean that.

550
00:19:23,991 --> 00:19:25,529
我以为你最爱吃西葫芦面包
And I thought zucchini bread was your favorite.

551
00:19:25,529 --> 00:19:27,240
否则我为什么要买西葫芦
Why -- why am I buying zucchini?

552
00:19:27,240 --> 00:19:29,320
一个人就不能既喜欢西葫芦面包
Hey, can't a guy like zucchini bread

553
00:19:29,320 --> 00:19:30,680
又喜欢玉米面包吗
and corn bread?

554
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:32,220
-菲尔 -见鬼
- Phil? - Damn it.

555
00:19:32,320 --> 00:19:32,820
罗妮
Ronnie!

556
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:35,040
你不是说去看医生吗
I thought you had a doctor's appointment.

557
00:19:35,040 --> 00:19:37,060
所以你才没能去看达雷尔的游泳比赛
That's why you had to miss Darrell's swim meet.

558
00:19:37,060 --> 00:19:37,640
她是谁
Who's she?

559
00:19:37,940 --> 00:19:38,940
只是另一位客户
Just another client.

560
00:19:39,100 --> 00:19:40,140
只是另一位客户
"Just another client"?

561
00:19:40,200 --> 00:19:41,780
不是这意思 谁找我
No, that's -- what is this?

562
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:44,000
是我办公室打来的
Uh-oh, it is. It's my office.

563
00:19:44,280 --> 00:19:45,240
得接一下
Got to take it.

564
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:46,500
-喂 -菲尔
- Hello? - Phil?

565
00:19:47,500 --> 00:19:48,020
克莱尔
Claire?

566
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,360
全世界最好的房产中介
World's greatest realtor.

567
00:19:50,580 --> 00:19:51,940
你怎么来了
What are you doing here?

568
00:19:52,020 --> 00:19:53,400
你头发出汗了
Your hair is sweating.

569
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:55,500
那是因为看到朋友们我太激动了
That's 'cause I'm excited to see my friends.

570
00:19:55,500 --> 00:19:56,740
快走 小家伙
Let's go, buddy.

571
00:19:57,800 --> 00:19:59,860
你们全是菲尔的客户吗
Are you all clients of Phil's?

572
00:20:00,060 --> 00:20:00,540
显然是的
Apparently.

573
00:20:00,691 --> 00:20:03,820
你们不可能碰到更好的人了
Well, you could not be in better hands.

574
00:20:03,820 --> 00:20:07,140
我在人生最低潮时认识了菲尔
I met Phil when I was at such a rocky place in my life.

575
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:09,960
早上中午夜晚 他随叫随到
He was available to me morning, noon, and night.

576
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:11,640
当然他帮我找到了梦想之家
Of course he found me my dream house,

577
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:13,420
但最棒的还不在这一点
but that wasn't the best part.

578
00:20:13,760 --> 00:20:16,860
菲尔教会我如何再次相信男人
Phil taught me how to trust a man again,

579
00:20:16,860 --> 00:20:19,260
我想他的目的不在卖房子 而是帮人
and I think that was always his plan.

580
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:20,460
我目的不在卖房子 而是帮人
That was always my plan.

581
00:20:21,380 --> 00:20:23,480
我碰到那样的前夫 让我再次相信男人
And it was not easy for me to trust a man

582
00:20:23,480 --> 00:20:25,000
还真是不太容易
after the husband that I'd had.

583
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:27,360
那家伙把工具随便扔在院子里
This guys left tools in the yard,

584
00:20:27,360 --> 00:20:28,820
让孩子们乱来
let the kids run wild.

585
00:20:28,820 --> 00:20:29,880
很高兴见到你 克莱尔
Well, great to see you, Claire.

586
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:31,640
他总是打断我说话
He was always interrupting me.

587
00:20:31,640 --> 00:20:34,600
他戴的睡眠眼罩真是笑死人了
And he wore the most ridiculous sleep-mask thing.

588
00:20:34,600 --> 00:20:36,720
我的天 听起来好娘啊
Oh, god, sounds like such a diva.

589
00:20:36,820 --> 00:20:38,120
也许他是对光很敏感
Or he's photosensitive,

590
00:20:38,120 --> 00:20:39,520
这毛病很严重的
which is a real condition.

591
00:20:40,560 --> 00:20:41,800
他从来不听我的意见
Never took my advice.

592
00:20:41,840 --> 00:20:42,920
这是最糟糕的
You know, that's the worst part.

593
00:20:42,920 --> 00:20:45,880
他从来没说过抱歉 一次也没有
He never -- he never said he was sorry just one time.

594
00:20:45,880 --> 00:20:47,460
我只想听他说一句
I would kill to have heard,

595
00:20:48,100 --> 00:20:50,260
"克莱尔 你是对的"
"Claire, you were right."

596
00:20:51,980 --> 00:20:53,660
她是对的
She was right.

597
00:20:54,980 --> 00:20:55,420
大声点
Louder.

598
00:20:56,200 --> 00:20:59,380
我不喜欢你的这一面
I do not love this side of you.

599
00:21:02,500 --> 00:21:04,020
多谢你帮我赢回了电脑
Thanks for winning my computer back.

600
00:21:04,220 --> 00:21:06,220
还有我的钱 真是太厉害了
And getting me all my money. That was awesome.

601
00:21:06,820 --> 00:21:08,140
如果我那时收手就好了
Yeah, if only I had stopped there,

602
00:21:08,140 --> 00:21:09,300
但我就是不懂见好就收
but I had to go back down.

603
00:21:09,940 --> 00:21:11,300
我太贪心了 又粗心大意
I got greedy, and I was careless.

604
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:14,520
我记得在学校学过一个寓言
There's a story about that I remember from school.

605
00:21:14,860 --> 00:21:17,840
伊卡洛斯飞得离儿子太近
Icarus flew too close to his son.

606
00:21:17,840 --> 00:21:19,240
我想他们的翅膀撞上了
I think their wings bumped.

607
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:21,040
其中有一个掉了下去 他们可能是鸭子
One of them fell. They might have been ducks.

608
00:21:21,040 --> 00:21:23,920
总之 教训就是 你得注意点儿
Anyway, the lesson is, is that you have to pay attention.

609
00:21:23,920 --> 00:21:25,720
否则要付出终极代价
Or pay the ultimate price.

610
00:21:27,440 --> 00:21:27,880
可以走了吗 亲爱的
Shall we, my dear?

611
00:21:28,780 --> 00:21:29,320
不用等门
Don't wait up.

612
00:21:29,560 --> 00:21:30,140
要等
Wait up.
